<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>No person other than a purchaser at retail for his own use and consumption shall remove, deface, cover, obliterate, mutilate, alter, or cause to be removed, defaced, covered, obliterated, mutilated, or altered any label required to be placed on a picture tube by this code.</p></caml:Content>